  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Senegal &#x2013; Incubation programme (II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this project, the Orange Corners Senegal incubation programme will be developed. This will strengthen the startup infrastructure in Senegal by offering an incubation programme in Dakar for 80 young entrepreneurs and enabling them to create new innovative businesses. At least 40% of these social entrepreneurs will be women, thereby supporting equal opportunities for women.The incubatees get the opportunity to collaborate and work with like-minded individuals in order to start and grow their sport related business. The incubation programme, focusing particularly on entrepreneurs in Dakar, offers training, business development support, masterclasses, events, coaching and mentoring sessions.Through collaboration between the private and public sector, Orange Corners combines forces to contribute towards the economic growth of Senegal and strengthen the Senegalese start-up ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
